  [PASS] C1a  transverse flux coefficient = mu_e = 1 - e^{-eta} (softer direction)
        F_transverse = 1 - exp(-eta)
  [PASS] C1b  longitudinal flux coefficient = mu_e*q, q = 1 + L_e, L_e = eta/(e^eta-1) (stiffer direction)
        F_long = (eta + exp(eta) - 1)*exp(-eta)   ;   mu_e*q = (eta + exp(eta) - 1)*exp(-eta)
        => EFD internal Poisson:  mu_e (d_x^2 + d_y^2 + q d_z^2) phi = 4 pi G rho   (astra efe_kepler, reproduced)
  [PASS] C2a  equatorial (_|_) circular Omega^2 = GM/(mu_e sqrt(q) R^3)  =>  perp boost = 1/(mu_e sqrt(q))  (astra efe_kepler)
  [PASS] C2b  flattening eps_e = L_e/(1+L_e) reproduced (astra efe_kepler)
  [PASS] C3a  L_e -> 1 as eta->0 (q->2, deep-MOND EFD) and L_e -> 0 as eta->oo (q->1, Newtonian)
